1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * from [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mihr_Mardan '''Wikipedia'''], the free enyclopedia
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mihr Mardan''' (Persian: مهر مردان) was the third ruler of the Bavand dynasty from 688 to 717. Nothing more is known about him; he died in 755, and was succeeded by his son Surkhab II.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Source=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Madelung, W. (1975). "The Minor Dynasties of Northern Iran". In Frye, R.N. The Cambridge History of Iran, Volume 4: From the Arab Invasion to the Saljuqs. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press. pp. 198–249. ISBN 978-0-521-20093-
2 CONC 6.
