1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 99th generation. 600 to 675. 2nd and youngest son of Tao Zhi (滔之). Also known as Hong Yan (红岩-号).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lieutenant General of Jin An (晋安副将) and Governor of Jin An (晋安太守) during the reign of Tang Tai Zong (唐太宗). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Zheng (郑氏). Had 3 sons - Chong (冲), Shou Gong (守恭) and Shou Mei (守美).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十九世。公元600 - 公元675。滔之之幼子, 冲之父。号为红岩。
2 CONT
2 CONT 唐太宗时, 历晋安副将, 勤恤小民, 训诲子孙。
2 CONT
2 CONT 娶郑氏, 生三子 - 冲, 守恭, 守美。
2 CONT
2 CONT
